      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The city’s historic core hosts several National Register sites, including the Bank of Pee Dee Building, Covington Plantation House, and Alfred Dockery House.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
