      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Interstate 74 runs just two miles north of East Rockingham, offering a modern freeway link that follows a 13‑mile stretch south of the city.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
